\mathbb{P}\left(\left|\sum^{n}_{i=1}X_{i}-\mathbb{E}\left[\sum^{n}_{i=1}X_{i}\right]\right|\geq\epsilon\right)\leq\exp\left\{ -\frac{2\epsilon^{2}}{\sum^{n}_{i=1}(b_{i}-a_{i})^{2}}\right\} 
